OL,3,GNEWSACity of London chief tops UK Black
OL,4,APowerlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FIan Thomas, chief executive of the City
OL,7,Fof London Corporation, has been named
OL,8,Fthe UK's most influential Black Briton
OL,9,Fin this year's Black Powerlist awards.
OL,11,FThe 57-year old is the first Black
OL,12,Fperson to oversee the Square Mile's
OL,13,Fgoverning body in its more than
OL,14,F900-year history.
OL,16,FThe City of London Corporation is an
OL,17,Fadministrative body with responsibility
OL,18,Ffor London's central financial
OL,19,Fdistrict, headed by its own Lord Mayor.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
